OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 89, 'clobbered' with fine
OL,4,Adespite not parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 89-year-old driver said he was
OL,7,F"clobbered" with a parking fine despite
OL,8,Fdeciding against using a car park
OL,9,Fbecause he was unable to use his "old
OL,10,FNokia phone" to pay via an app.
OL,12,FRoland Nice had spent 30 years using
OL,13,Fthe Swan Lane car park in Haverhill,
OL,14,FSuffolk, without issue.
OL,16,FHowever, on 7 August, after driving his
OL,17,Fwhite van to the car park and looking
OL,18,Fat two ticket machines, he realised he
OL,19,Fcould no longer use cash.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
