OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 89, 'clobbered' with fine
OL,4,Adespite not parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter eight minutes of struggling to
OL,7,Fwork out how to pay, the former council
OL,8,Fworker drove off and parked elsewhere,
OL,9,Fonly to receive a #60 fine from
OL,10,Foperator Napier Parking Ltd a few days
OL,11,Flater. The firm has been contacted by
OL,12,Fthe BBC for comment.
